{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02878","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降 · 刘禕之","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梦梓光青陛，穠桃蔼紫宫。\n德优宸念远，礼备国姻崇。\n万户声明发，三条骑吹通。\n香轮送重景，彩斾引仙虹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禕之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}